{"ticker":"JUBLCPL","symbol":"JUBLCPL","instrumentId":3194184,"name":"Jubilant Agri And Co","industry":"NSE-Chemicals-Agricultural","about":"Jubilant Agri and Consumer Products Limited (JACPL) is a diversified business under the Jubilant Bhartia Group, excelling in consumer products, performance polymers, and agri solutions. It is India's 2nd largest wood adhesive brand with Jivanjor and Vamicol, and a major player in wood finishes under Charmwood and Ultra Italia. JACPL is the largest VP Latex manufacturer in India and 2nd largest globally, supplying to major tire manufacturers. It is also the only Indian supplier of food polymers (SPVA). In agriculture, its Ramban SSP fertilizer supports crop nutrition. With a strong innovation culture, JACPL exports to 35+ countries worldwide.","website":"www.jacpl.co.in","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:33:30.684Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":1766.2,"changePct":-4.151516796005861,"week52High":2437.6,"week52Low":1483},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹2,676 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹2,049 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"3,939,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"13"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"55,559"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"5.82"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.7"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"1.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.08"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.32"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"51%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"25.48"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"23–36"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"27.8%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"49.36"},{"label":"Volume","value":"1,577"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"6,907"},{"label":"Master score","value":"31"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"46"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"29"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"159"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating","value":"C-"}],"earningsAnnual":{"headers":["Year","EP